window.products.push({"id":608092,"name":"The Lucky Clover Trading Artisan Collection Slim Proofing Basket, 15\" x 3.75\" x 2.5\" at top Rim. Base Dimensions are 13\" Long by 2\" Wide, Natural Ratt","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41LgfaZy3sL._AC_.jpg","description":"This extra long narrow proofing basket is just what the baker needs in order to make the perfectly-shaped baguette. Made of natural rattan, this proofing basket, also known as a Benetton, is sturdy, allowing the dough to rise into a perfect baguette shape before it goes into the oven. French baguettes--a favorite of the artisan bread baker. Directions for Use: Get your proofing basket ready to shape your dough by coating it thoroughly with flour. With a soft cloth, rub the flour into the rattan so that all of the inside has a nice flour coating. Tap out the excess flour. Then you’re ready to put your baguette-shaped unrisen dough into the basket for its final rise. When your dough has risen, place a baking sheet on top of the basket and turn the basket over so that the shaped loaf rests on the baking sheet. Bake as usual. Or, you may heavily flour a smooth cotton towel with flour, gently shake off the excess, and put the towel inside the basket before placing your shaped dough in the basket. This method saves you from having to clean the basket each time it is used.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41LgfaZy3sL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Lucky Clover Trading","source_asin":"B00ETH6OC8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-608092","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ETH6OC8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ETH6OC8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
