window.products.push({"id":608165,"name":"MOJAY Modern Home Office Chair Upholstered Velvet Swivel Chair with Arms and Back for Adjustable Cute Vanity Chair for Bedroom Living Room Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ykE96+l4S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌺 SOFT & COMFORTABLE: The Ergonomic office chair features a curved shell backrest design that perfectly contours to the human back, helping to support and protect your spine. The upholstered seat is filled with highly resilient foam to provide you or your family with added comfort while working. 🌺 HIGH-QUALITY MATERIAL: Velvet fabric feels delicate, durable, and wrinkle-free. stable star base with a Silver coat makes the whole office chair more deluxe. The safe air pressure bar can adjust the seat cushion height from 16-19.7\", suitable for people of different heights. 🌺 FLEXIBILITY & PROTECTION: The computer chair is equipped with 5 360-degree rotating silent rollers, which move fast, can maintain a fast working rhythm, and protect the floor from wear. This chair can carry approximately 250 pounds. 🌺 PERFECT DECORATION: The elegant appearance makes it perfect to match different home decorations. It is very suitable for living room, bedroom, office, salon, dormitory, and can also be used as a dressing chair, which will definitely impress your guests. 🚚US WAREHOUSE FOR QUICK SHIPMENT. All necessary tools are included in the carton, easy to install. Please contact us freely if you have any problem with this product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ykE96+l4S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MOJAY","source_asin":"B0974HJNC6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-608165","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0974HJNC6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0974HJNC6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":608166,"name":"Couristan Recife Wicker Stitch Indoor/Outdoor Area Rug, 2'3\" x 11'9\" Runner, Cocoa-Natural","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":40.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71L+X7hDU5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1681/1500 Wicker Stitch Rug. This rug features a solid color inset with a small patterned border and comes in the following two colors: black/cocoa and cocoa/natural. Great for use in transitional, modern, and traditional decors. Don't Be Fooled. Every outdoor rug is 100% polypropylene… on the surface.  Most outdoor rugs use Jute beneath the surface to hold their rugs together.  While this does allow for a faster, easier production, it is subject to dry rot, and discoloration of connecting fibers. Unlike our competition, Couristan employs a 100% polypropylene binding system to ensure a longer lasting, higher quality indoor/outdoor rug. At Home Anywhere. Houses, Apartments, RVs, Townhomes, seriously any home.  Indoor or outdoor, a rug is a simple and inexpensive way to make any space feel like a home. It adds warmth underfoot, while softening the feel of any area. They can be used in high traffic areas, near pools, on patios, decks, kitchens, laundry rooms, basements—the list is endless. Color Beyond. Our colors penetrate the entire fiber and are mixed with a UV stabilizer to ensure that our rugs stay brighter for longer. Harsh Environments Demand Strict Testing. Couristan has been at the forefront of outdoor design and development since introducing the outdoor rug.  We believe that testing is our responsibility to you.   We set the standard by requiring that all our outdoor rugs pass 6 laboratory tests before earning the Couristan outdoor name. Kid and Pet Friendly. These rugs are paraben free, making them both kid and pet safe.  The rug can be hosed and dried outside, making it great for high traffic areas and rooms that see heavy use.  Kids are no match for this rug.   For over 90-years, the Couristan brand has been revered as an icon of style and quality for its exquisite area rugs. The Recife Rug Collection is one of our top selling outdoor collections. Home to a multitude of styles and colors.  If you love the concept of this performance indoor/outdoor rug, but haven’t found your perfect design or color, don’t fret. We’ve got you covered with a multitude of designs to fit almost any home.  Our durability is unparalleled making this a great rug for high traffic areas, homes with pets, or just about anyone looking for great quality and value.  Explore its line up and experience its benefits today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71L+X7hDU5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Couristan","source_asin":"B008TQKN2W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-608166","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008TQKN2W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008TQKN2W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
