window.products.push({"id":608257,"name":"MIYABI Mizu SG2 5.5\" Prep Knife","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":139.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WNeG-rE3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Miyabi celebrates Japanese craftsmanship with Mizu. Using traditional methods and innovative techniques, these knives merge the past and present into one exceptional knife collection. The SG2 micro-carbide powder stainless steel core is wrapped in another layer of stainless steel with a hammered (\"Tsuchime\") Damascus finish. The Cryodur heat treatment process results in a blade with a high Rockwell Hardness rating of 63, providing superior edge retention, corrosion resistance and blade flexibility. Miyabi artisans then perform the Honbazuke sharpening method that originated from traditional Japanese sword making. This 3-step process includes sharpening the blades twice on whetstones, followed by mirror polishing on a leather wheel. Used over 1000 years ago for samurai swords, this is what gives these knives their signature Miyabi razor sharpness. The meticulously crafted blade is then accompanied by a stunning, comfortable and durable D-shaped Micarta handle and stainless steel bolster. Beautiful accents adorn the handle including a decorative mosaic pin, red spacers, the Miyabi logo engraved on the handle end. Handcrafted in Seki, Japan.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WNeG-rE3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MIYABI","source_asin":"B08BJDLPRN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-608257","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BJDLPRN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BJDLPRN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":608258,"name":"All-Clad Cop-R-Chef 1-Quart Saucier Pan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ddXwgIKfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product description Copper has always been the best conductor of heat, and this Saucier Pan, part of All-Clad's Cop-R-Chef collection, is among the best cookware has to offer in quality and performance. Its 1-qt. capacity is great for preparing sauces, melting butter or chocolate and heating or reheating food. Copper exterior on bottom and sides combined with a heavy aluminum core ensures your food will cook evenly and thoroughly. You'll rarely need to heat the pan above medium temperature. All-Clad is the undisputed choice among 4-star chefs and is available in five distinct designs. Amazon.com Gleaming with Old World elegance, All-Clad's Cop-R-Chef copper-clad cookware dresses up a kitchen while providing serious and professional cooks with all the virtues that make All-Clad's worldwide reputation unsurpassed. Key to its high performance is a three-ply, bonded construction. Sandwiched between the bright exterior and an 18/10 stainless-steel interior lies a thick core of pure aluminum that spreads heat evenly across the bottoms of pots and pans and all the way up the sides. The interior is highly polished so it's stick- as well as corrosion-resistant. With care, the copper exterior remains beautiful during this cookware's lifetime warranty against defects--and beyond. This classic, versatile 1-quart saucier pan has rounded sides that increase the amount of food the pan can hold relative to the diameter of its bottom. Because the aluminum core extends up the sides, foods cook uniformly in the pan, even though it's 2-1/4 inches deep. And because the interior is nonreactive, tomato-based sauces and other acidic foods won't taste metallic. Its polished 18/10 stainless-steel pan and handle is riveted for strength and grooved for comfort. The long handle (holed for hanging on a hook or peg) stays cool on the stovetop but won't be harmed by an oven's heat. Because harsh detergents darken copper, hand washing this cookware is recommended. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ddXwgIKfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"All-Clad","source_asin":"B00005AL8A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-608258","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00005AL8A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00005AL8A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":608259,"name":"Mi Zone Mirimar Duvet Cover King Size - Aqua , Pleated Ruched Ruffles Duvet Cover Set – 4 Piece – Ultra Soft Microfiber Light Weight Bed Comforter Cov","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/915XvE88RrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Give your bedroom a graceful update with the Mi Zone Mirimar Duvet Cover Set. The ruched detailing seen on the duvet cover and matching sham(s) creates a soft, elegant look that makes your bedroom look irresistibly comfortable. A charming decorative pillow completes this bedding set with an embroidered leaf and bird motif. Made from ultra-soft microfiber, this bright duvet cover set has a luxuriously soft feel and is machine washable for easy care. Button closures allow you to place a down comforter insert inside the duvet cover for added warmth and comfort.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/915XvE88RrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mi-Zone","source_asin":"B00GN59TGW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-608259","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GN59TGW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GN59TGW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
