window.products.push({"id":608279,"name":"YEVIOR Mini Bag Sealer, Chargeable Plastic Bag Resealer, Handheld Heat Sealer Chip Sealer, Portable Bag Sealer Food Storage Snack Fresh Bag Sealer, US","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51jaA7KdCFL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"A good kitchen helper, sealing various bags! It’s a great help for you to store your leftover snacks, foods, fruits and so on to avoid waste and mold growth, keep foods freshness. Mini Bag Sealer has been improved and upgraded for many times, appropriated for various bags. Coated aluminum foil bags are recommended PP, PE, PVC bags with thickness no more than 0.3mm. Such as storage bags, potato chip bags, fruit bags, sugar bags and so on. Mini heat sealer for food storage bags with a hanging strip and the magnetic back, you can hang on the wall, behind the door, or stick it to the refrigerator for saving space. How to Use: Charge it until the light turns off. Press the button to turn it on and start to work. Press the button and hold for 3-5 seconds to heat up for work. Put the opened bag in the middle of the sealer and slowly pull it at a constant speed. For better results, the seal can be repeated multiple times. Warm Tips: 1. When the power supply is insufficient, the sealing effect will be affected. Please charge the sealing machine in time. 2. Please don't use hard or sharp items to insert in the heating film of the sealing area, to avoid damaging the bag heat sealer. 3. Please keep this bag heat sealer away from children’s touching. 4. To avoid any defect, please keep the bag heat sealer clean and dry; once getting moisture, please dry it with a cloth in time. Package Contents: 1 x Bag Sealer 1 x USB Cable 1 x Use Manual When you receive a product with damaged packaging or other products after you purchase it, please contact us or Amazon customer service in time to help you solve the problem.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51jaA7KdCFL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YEVIOR","source_asin":"B092C942BB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-608279","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092C942BB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092C942BB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
