window.products.push({"id":608317,"name":"8-Count Round Paper Dinner Plates, Wild at One Giraffe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ihfEGwZkL._AC_.jpg","description":"From the Manufacturer Turning one is wild and fun with this baby giraffe. Traditional pink gets a snazzy touch up of fun lime green. Whether you are planning just an intimate gathering of close family and friends or an all out huge party, a baby's first birthday is bound to be special. Make the day, memories and photographs even more irreplaceable with our Wild at One collection in green and pink from Creative Converting. Party animals young and old alike will go wild for the baby giraffe and pastel giraffe print design. Paper dinner plates are an 8.75\" diameter, coated for durability and no mess clean up and come 8 plates to a package. From invitations before the big day to balloons tied to the guest of honor's chair, this ensemble has everything to make the celebration worth remembering. There are matching dinner and dessert plates, lunch napkins, cups, new two-tone duo cutlery and plastic table covers. Don't forget to add to your birthday decor with coordinating high chair kits, cupcake displays, candy and punch bowls, favor bags, centerpieces, decorative banners, paper tissue lanterns, foil and glitter garlands, balloons and placemats from Creative Converting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ihfEGwZkL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Creative Converting","source_asin":"B00E1RR40W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-608317","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00E1RR40W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00E1RR40W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":608318,"name":"iCoffee RSS500-MOZ 72 oz Mozart Single Serve Coffee Brewer with Spin Brew Technology, Large, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LNAFMeXuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ICoffee by Remington brings patented Spin Brew technology to our easy to use single serve coffee brewer. Our technology spins, steams and stirs the coffee inside the pod while brewing which creates a smoother flavor and creates a richer fuller cup of coffee. Our brewer works with all K-style cups including K-Cup, One Cup, Real Cup capsules - plus EVERY private label brand cups. The Express also features our Pour' n Brew function which allows you to add water for the size beverage you want. You can make a 4, 6, 8, 10 or 12 ounce drink. Our unit is also BPA free and has a compact design.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LNAFMeXuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iCoffee","source_asin":"B00RVW890I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-608318","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00RVW890I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00RVW890I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":608319,"name":"Yoshihiro Mizu Yaki Blue High Carbon Steel #1 Kurouchi Kiritsuke Japanese Multipurpose Knife Shitan Handle (9.5'' (240mm) & Saya)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BL3yIhaRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Knife Features → Blade Material: High Carbon Blue Steel #1  →Edge Angle: Double Edged  →Grade: Mizu Yaki Kurouchi  →Handle Shape: Octagonal  →Handle Material: Rosewood  →HRC:63-64  →Knife Style: Kiritsuke Multipurpose Chef Knife  →Stain Resistant: No  →Saya Cover: Optional Magnolia Saya Knife Cover  Our handmade Yoshihiro Mizu Yaki Kurouchi Series are unparalleled in their performance. Mizu Yaki is a meticulous process of pure water quenching that draws out the hardness of refined steel while infusing it with enough resiliency to perform consistently in the most exacting of conditions. The Black Forged 'Kurouchi' finish consists of the carbonized coating created during heat treating and provides for a characteristic look and a rustic aesthetic to the blade.With a hardness on the Rockwell scale of 63-64, the inner core of Blue High Carbon Steel #1 is prized for its high edge retention. It is sandwiched in between carbon steel in the traditional Warikomi style to add to its durability and ease sharpening. Proudly made in Japan and not mass produced. This knife is complimented with a traditional Japanese Wa-style handcrafted Octagonal Handle that is lightweight and ergonomically welds to the hand for seamless use. An optional and recommended protective wooden sheath called a Saya can be purchased together, which protects the knife and adds to its appearance when not in use. Traditional Japanese knife making values a sharp edge, which requires attention and care. Sharpening and honing should be done with only water whetstones. Hand wash and dry only, and do so immediately if working with acidic ingredients. Do not use on objects such as bones, nutshells, and frozen foods. Carbon steel can oxidize if not properly maintained. Keep dry and oil regularly to prevent oxidation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BL3yIhaRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yoshihiro","source_asin":"B083W362CF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-608319","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083W362CF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083W362CF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
