window.products.push({"id":608362,"name":"Sage Smudge Kit - 6 Smudge Sticks for Cleansing, Healing, Meditation - 7 Chakra, Peppermint White Sage Mix, Rose Petal Sage, Sage Brush, Lavender with","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-n35nUdeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Smudge is a great way to up-level your environment-cleaning and boost positive energy in your home. By purifying your mind, body, objects, and environment, you'll feel more connected with your inner self and find better ways to level up your emotional and spiritual level. A conscious cleansing using smudge will help you to wave away negative energy and feelings and on the other hand bring a positive spirit. This 6 piece kit is featured with everything you need to comply with your cleansing goals, the set includes: - Sage Brush Stick: used to 'wash off' the outside. Use these traditional herbs for cleansing your space of negative thoughts and influences. - White Sage with Rose Petals: bring the benefits of the white sage with beautifully wrapped rose petals that will enhance the fragrance of the sacred smoke bringing an enjoyable and natural aroma. -7 Rose Chakra Sage: this beautiful stick is a colorful White Sage smudge stick covered with colorful 7 rose petals. The rose petal colors are aligned with the seven chakras making this a perfect smudge for cleansing your space and yourself as you align your chakras. -Peppermint and White Sage Mix: Peppermint is simply refreshing and soothing. This mixture enhances the healing and protection power of sage while combining the aromas of these plants.. -White Sage, Blue Sage and Yerba Santa: especially useful in clearing the atmosphere in and around your home or space. This combination is widely used for cleansing, healing and purification purposes, it provides spiritual strength and will help to remove the malevolent spirits. - Lavender: lavender is a lovely scented combination. Burning this stick will help encourage a restful night's sleep as well as peace of mind, relaxation and happiness. Add a deeper sense of calm and peace to your space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-n35nUdeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HIPFREE","source_asin":"B08B441NHS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-608362","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08B441NHS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08B441NHS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
