window.products.push({"id":608423,"name":"Nambe Vista 5-Piece Stainless Steel Place Setting, Service for 1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gXKAzOkAS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Sleek styling reflects the promise of a flawless table. Sophisticated contours define a nice balance between function and fashion. Forged of dishwasher safe 18/10 Stainless Steel, Vista¿s perennial Amazon.com Like many Nambé flatware patterns, Vista brings stylish simplicity to everyday dining. Designed by New York-based designer Lou Henry, the flatware features straight, tapered handles with blunt ends that feel well-balanced and weighty. The spoon bowls are sleek oversized ovals, the fork tines elegantly long, and the knife blade forms an unusual angle between the neck and the rounded tip. Dishwasher-safe to allow more time for life's more important things, Nambé flatware is forged from 18/10 stainless steel and finished with a mirror shine. This five-piece single place setting consists of a dinner knife, dinner fork, salad fork, soup spoon, and teaspoon. Nambé was founded in 1951 in a village of the same name in scenic northern New Mexico. From the beginning, the company has focused on hand-producing high-quality, functional items such as metal bowls and trays with great attention to timeless, modern design. Stainless steel, porcelain, and crystal pieces now join Nambé's signature metal-alloy lines, all of which make exceptional gifts. Nambé has won numerous design awards, has been shown in or recognized by nearly two dozen museums worldwide, and is part of the permanent collections of many, including the Museum of Modern Art in New York. --Ann Bieri What's in the Box 1 place setting. The place setting consists of: dinner knife; dinner fork; salad fork; soup spoon; teaspoon. 5 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gXKAzOkAS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"nambe","source_asin":"B000VXVCCG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-608423","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000VXVCCG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000VXVCCG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
