window.products.push({"id":608540,"name":"Univivi Mini Storage Baskets Foldable Fabric Storage Bins with Handles Versatile Trapezoid Small Storage Box Idea for Bathroom, Kitchen, Vanity Cabine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JekOx+SEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Polyester Trapezoidal Design-The small fabric basket is trapezoidal design, which makes it convenient to find things, also allows easy access when placed on the top shelf. And the small front handle makes it easy to pull out the storage bins for storage. Foldable & Detachable-The small fabric storage bins are foldable. By removing the base plate, the fabric baskets can be easily folded flat to save space when not in use. And the baskets are easy to store in a drawer or other corner. Superior Material- The organizer baskets are made of Bamboo Fabric with strong MDF board. The four sides of the closet baskets are filled with cardboard, ensuring an upright structure that won't collapse easily. It's durable, odourless. Multipurpose-You can use it anywhere. In the kitchen, it can be used for the storage of dipping materials, dishes, etc. In the bathroom, it can be used for shampoo, shower gel, body milk, etc. In the make-up station, it can be used to store liquid foundation, make-up eggs, eye shadow, etc. on the desk, it can be used to store snacks, fruit, etc. and In the closet, it can be used to store Scarves, Socks, Underwear,Tie setc. The fabric storage cubes is also suitable for your office. Mini baskets-Set of 6 fabric bins, the size of each small closet baskets is 7.9L x 7.9W x 5.9H Inches. These small bins for a closet organization can meet many storage needs while keeping your home nice and tidy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JekOx+SEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Univivi","source_asin":"B08WZGVHZJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-608540","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08WZGVHZJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08WZGVHZJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
