window.products.push({"id":608566,"name":"Yoolax Motorized No Tools No Drill Roller Blinds (Blackout Linen Beige)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":179.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SJgvj3PGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FABRIC MATERIALS:Yoolax Motorized Roller Shade No-Drill Linen Beige is made of Polyester. It can provide your room with 100% blackout effect. With a feather duster or dishcloth towel you can clean the shade easily. Thanks to the wireless design is it also safe for your children and pets. Installation in bedroom, living room and kitchen is highly recommended. NO DRILL AND FUNCTIONAL: Don't want to leave marks on your walls when installing shades? Yoolax Motorized Roller Shade No-Drill is a good option for you. With our special mounting parts you can now clamp the shade directly on your window frame or door frame. (The Width of window/door frame should be between 0.2inch and 0.83inch. ) Compared to other no drill roller shade is ours more stable and will NOT easily fall down. The fabric can isolate the heat from outside in summer and keep your room warm in winter, which is a good way to save energy. It also provides excellent privacy protection, as it blocks out the view of the outside world to 100%. SMART MOTOR&CONTROL: Yoolax Motorized Roller Shade No-Drill is configurated with Remote Battery Motor. The shade can run about 202 times after a full charge of 6 hours. It is compatiblel with 15-Channel Remote Control, which allows you to control maximal 15 Shades separatly or as a group with only one remote. Attention: Connection with Alexa and Google Assistant requires a smart bridge. Connect to smart Assistant or Yoolax Home App for more advanced functions like timing control and Location Control etc... CUSTOMIZATION: Motorized Roller Shade No-Drill is custom made.Press the \"Customize Now\" button on the top right and start to make your own shade. (Width: 20\"-47\", Height maximal 58\".) Please follow the guide to place the order. We will send an email to all customers to double confirm the size in 24 hours, please pay attention to the email the day after your order. About special requirements on size you can contact us via Amazon message. ACCESSORIES: You can choose Yoolax Sleek Alloy Bar or Fabric Wrapped rod as your bottom rod. USB charging wire extension of 78\" is also available. SERVICE: Usually dispatched in 4-5 workdays after size confirmed. The remote is basically programmed before shipment. Yoolax offers a 2-year warranty on motors and controls. Any damage or failure of motors or controls happens in the first 2 years, we provide repair or replacement free of charge. Receiving damage of fabric or components, please take photos, send them to us within 30 days, we'll work with you for free replacement at a valid time. Warranty Year Extend Service is also available on Customize Page. Attention: We recommend you to buy our fabric samples when you're not sure if the fabric can fulfill your needs or not.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SJgvj3PGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yoolax","source_asin":"B0C36TQ2HG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-608566","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C36TQ2HG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C36TQ2HG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
