window.products.push({"id":608606,"name":"Maxmartt Bath Bomb Mixer, Stainless Steel Ball Maker Non-Stick Meat Baller Tongs for Meatball, Cake, Ice Cream, Bath Bombs (Ball Size:1.77 * 1.85in)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.09,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51a1TirzCBL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Features:【Food grade stainless steel meatballer】The meatball maker is made of non-toxic and durable stainless steel,won't tarnish or oxidize easy,high strength,corrosion resistance,high temperature resistance.【Non-stick ball maker】Stainless steel ball scoop tongs are smooth and food won't stick to it,making it easy to clean. Great kitchen pop tongs for scooping melon balls,cookie dough or sorbet.【Easy to use】Put chopped meat on the scoop,then clip it,the redundant meat will squeeze out from the hole on it. Also perfect ball maker for cake pop and bath bombs.【Widely used】Cake pop maker can be also used as ice ball maker,ice cream scoop,cookie dough scoops,rice ball makers,fruit ball maker,snowball maker and bath bomb maker!【Size】Baller Size: Approx. 4.5 * 4.7cm / 1.77 * 1.85inSpecifications:Condition: NewMaterial: Stainless steelColor: SilverSize(L * W): Approx. 17.5 * 7.6cm / 6.89 * 2.99inBaller Size: Approx. 4.5 * 4.7cm / 1.77 * 1.85inWeight: Approx. 78gPackage Includes:1 x Stainless steel meatballerNotice:1.Due to manual measurement,please allow 0-0.05 inch error and make sure you don't mind before ordering,thank you for your understanding.2.Please understand that there may be subtle chromatic aberrations between objects and images,and we that we have adjusted to the most realistic state.3.If you have any product problems,please contact us in time,we will provide you with the best service and wish you a happy life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51a1TirzCBL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Maxmartt","source_asin":"B07W3TRMWN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-608606","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07W3TRMWN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07W3TRMWN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":608607,"name":"Elegant Comfort Wrinkle-Free 1500 Thread Count Egyptian Quality Deep Pocket, 4-Piece Bed Sheet Set , Full, Petunias-White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FkD9i9DcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Experience the epitome of luxury with our double-brushed sheets set. Incredibly soft and just as soothing, they're unlike anything that you've ever slept on before. They include 1 fitted sheet and 1 flat sheet, along with pillowcases, and provide your bedroom with a fresh look and feel that you will want to immediately indulge in. Absolutely plush and super soft, each piece is made with cozy wrinkle-resistant fabric that is durable enough to last for years to come. Treat yourself to this soft and silky bedtime experience for a good night's sleep that you will cherish each and every night. This set also makes a wonderful gift for the hard worker who deserves a break from a long days on the job. Elegant Comfort NOTE : TWIN SIZE SHEET SET IS 3 PC SET. --- IT COMES WITH ONLY 1 PILLOWCASE","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FkD9i9DcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elegant Comfort","source_asin":"B007OROPGM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-608607","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007OROPGM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007OROPGM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":608608,"name":"WALLFARM Stainless Steel Granny Fork, 3-Tines, Meat Fork, Barbecue Fork, Carving Fork for Grilling, Barbecue, Serving, Roasting, 10-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Yir+p6AQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ergonomic Design: Our carving fork is made from a single, solid piece of stainless steel, and features a durable plastic handle that is securely riveted with three stainless steel rivets for added strength and stability. The square design of the handle is more suitable for different hand types, ensuring a comfortable grip that won't slip or cause discomfort. This makes it a great tool for grilling, barbecuing, and cooking, and ensures that you can enjoy your meals with joy and satisfaction. Premium Quality: The meat fork is made of food-grade 304 stainless steel, is heat resistant. It means that the product is suitable for cooking. The Meat fork does not leave stains, no plaque, or rust over time is not easily damaged and is easy to clean. Easy to Use: With our carving meat fork, you can easily hold roast meat while carving or slicing. Besides, you can use a carving fork to pick up foods, turn them while cooking, or even hold the meat as you carve. Versatile Kitchen Tool: The Granny fork, also known as a cooking fork, curved meat fork, barbecue fork, or carving fork, is a versatile three-pronged kitchen utensil. It's a must-have tool for grilling, barbecuing, and cooking, making it an essential kitchen accessory. You can use it to pick up and turn foods while cooking, grilling, or barbecuing. Our Granny Fork is also great for outdoor activities such as camping, picnics, or cooking in the garden. Easy to Clean and Preserve: the carving meat fork with a long handle for easy use and safety. Meat fork is dishwasher safe for fast, easy cleanup.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Yir+p6AQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WALLFARM","source_asin":"B08FRM2KTC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-608608","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FRM2KTC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FRM2KTC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
