window.products.push({"id":608612,"name":"VARIYATTA Air Fryer Liners Disposable - 110 Pieces Large (7.9inch-20cm) Oil-proof - Water-proof - Food Grade Air Fryer Parchment Paper Sheets - Unblea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qmomJZL4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our story: How we got our start? VARIYATTA had a great start with its wonderful air fryer paper liners in the wholesale market with the purpose to achieve customers' trust by simplifying their livelihood and providing environmental and health-friendly products and one-stop solutions for all their desired needs. This year we decided to provide our wonderful parchment paper liners on Amazon and since then we are booming every single day. We’ve now extended our purpose-led brand VARIYATTA to the next level to start selling on Amazon marketplaces. What makes our product unique? The secret is the high-quality unbleached wood pulp made out of leafy trees (like birch and eucalyptus) with food-grade silicone oil coated on both sides of the paper. It is compostable and no fluorescent agent is used in the material. It’s incredibly strong and durable to an extent where the single piece can also be used for at least two batches soaking up greasy food and no clean-up is required giving you a smooth experience. You can use it for Air Fryer, Pellet Smoker, Baking, Cooking, Microwave Oven, etc. Why do we love what we do? We love our product because we are a small business but an expert in providing the best quality air fryer liners to you. We are a team of a hardworking and committed specialists. We love our brand VARIYATTA which let us work day and night to make our liners the best in quality.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qmomJZL4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B09YP9VSHZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-608612","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YP9VSHZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YP9VSHZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
