window.products.push({"id":608614,"name":"Xpanal Home Decorative Cold Solid Glitter Sequins Square Throw Pillow Covers Cushion Case for Wedding Party,16\"x16\"(40cmx40cm), Black, 2 Packs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91akZo2-uxS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our sequin throw pillow cover brings you fun and matches your home decor great. The beautiful sequins and bright color are just perfect for you, which will bring a good mood to relax yourself after whole day work. It is great choice to light up your life with these pillow covers. Please Note: 1. Washing Tips: Turn it inside out and wash it by hand. Swish it through warm soapy water, rinse and press between towels to remove excess water. Then lay flat to dry for protect sequin. No bleach or iron. Air dry only.The sequins Cushion Cover is not easy to flip,very tight and shiny.Turn it over gently before washing. 2. Due to the shooting and different computer monitor, The actually color may be slightly different as pictures. Applications: 1. Home : Luxury sequin pillow covers will bring you fun and matches your home decor great wherever they are placed. 2. Party : Shiny sparkling pillow covers also are great decoration for your birthday party or home party. 3. Wedding : Sequin pillow covers will bring more color to your wedding.It is great decoration for formal event or wedding. 4. Festivals : Sequin pillowcase cover add to the festive atmosphere on Christmas Day, Halloween, and Thanksgiving day. Installation Steps： 1. Open the zipper, fold your insert to put it in the pillow cover. 2. Put the left part of the pillow slowly to avoid the zipper split. 3. Gently rub the corners and make it flatten. 4. Finally, zip up the cover gently. Specification: Material: 3mm sequins on one side and soft satin material on other side; Zipper: Smoothly, fit pillow perfectly; Color: Black; Royal Blue; Silver Tone; Red; Gold; Rose Gold; Total size：16 x 16 inch（40 x 40 cm);","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91akZo2-uxS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Xpanal","source_asin":"B08Z4CXFHD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-608614","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Z4CXFHD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Z4CXFHD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
