window.products.push({"id":608716,"name":"VIIMI Toaster, 2 Slice Stainless Steel toaster, 6 Shade Settings 1.5in Extra-Wide Slot Toaster with Bagel, Cancel, Defrost, Reheat Function Removable ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614YM1KPPVL._AC_SL1472_.jpg","description":"●Bagel, Defrost, Cancel Bagel setting toasts the inside and warms the outside, defrost setting for defrosting bread, Cancel function ends toasting at any time. Indicator lights make it easy to see the selected setting at a glance. ●Extra-Wide Slots Extra wide 1.5 inch slots can accommodate a perfect toasting for whatever you're toasting. Such as Handle bagels, English muffins, thick sliced homemade breads and so on. The slots adjust to fit thin bread slices or thick bagels with ease. ●Built-In Cord Storage The cord storage wraps up easily in the base of the toaster. When finished using the toaster, simply unplug it, and use the handy cord wrap for tidy storage. Rubber feet base care your counter a lot. makes it easy to situate the toaster right where you want it. ●High Lift Lever With extra high lift lever, not only no more burning fingertips when removing smaller pieces of toast, but also make easily raises for smaller slices of bread to help ensure safe retrieval. or see toasting progress at any time. ●6-Shade Settings The 6 different shades means different toasting timer, choose lower settings for lighter toast or higher settings for darker, crispier toast. ▶Settings 1-2: light shade of toast. ▶Settings 3-4: medium shade of toast. ▶Settings 5-6: dark shade of toast. How to use toaster? ☞Step 1: Put the bread maker into the bread trough and turn on the power. ☞Step 2: Select the appropriate gear (1-6) and pull down the Start Knob. ☞Step 3: Wait about 2 minutes, the toasted bread will pop out automatically. Tips: ❎ Unplug the cooled stainless steel toaster before cleaning. ❎ Do not take out the bread and crumbs while the toaster is working. ❎ Toaster cannot be operated without a breadcrumb tray. ❎ Do not spray the detergent directly on the bread machine.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614YM1KPPVL._AC_SL1472_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VIIMI","source_asin":"B09XTPHGMT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-608716","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XTPHGMT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XTPHGMT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
