window.products.push({"id":608812,"name":"Portable Blender, 【2019 Newest】Lengor USB Rechargeable Smoothie Personal Blender Fruit Mixer Six Blades in 3D, 480ml Glass Juicer Cup with 4000mAh,Tra","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61i-Hte4puL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Lengor 【2019 Newest】 Portable Blender, Take Your Life Easier! Why to choose Lengor? · Great for making drinks, smoothies, protein shakes, juices and food preps.· Perfect for outdoor, easy to take to your office, gym or class.· We will send you a recipe, you can refer to the recipe or make juice according to your preference. · Lifetime warranty and 100% money back guarantee. Notice: 1）This travel blender is not suitable for bullet-proof coffee or hot drink more than 50 degree which will be easy cause leakage, please don't use for that purpose.2）Don't let the charging base get wet,If it gets wet, please dry it with a dry towel.3 ) Don't put your hands inside your blender or try to touch the blades.4 ) Don't use your blender when charging or run your blender without anything inside. How to use? Step 1 Cut the fruit into small pieces about 1.5-2cm. (Crushed ice is acceptable.)Step 2 Add milk or water according to your flavor.(Don't exceed 4/5 of the bottle).Step 3 Hold the button for 2 second to start,shake the machine to make delicious juice just need 30 seconds. Feature: 1）Fully charge your blender 4~5 hours when first using, then 2 hour is ok for every charge.2 ) Smart Power Reminder : When Red light on,0-20% power left; Blue light 21-80%;White light,81-100% Full power.3 ) To control the capacity of juice under the 70%-80% cup body capacity is appropriate How to clean the blender? Pour half of the cup water in the cup, turn on the blender for about 5 second, then pour out the dirty water. (Please keep the base away from the water when cleaning.) Package Included: 1*High-quality package1*Portable personal blender1*User manual1*Charging Cable1*Recipe Book","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61i-Hte4puL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lengor","source_asin":"B07RTX5P78","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-608812","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RTX5P78","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RTX5P78","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
