window.products.push({"id":608847,"name":"1-Gallon Glass Beverage Dispenser with Stainless Steel Spigot - [2 Pack] Drink Dispensers for Parties - Mason Jar Drinking Dispenser with Lid, Wooden ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81AZyM8-mUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"VERSATILE BEVERAGE DISPENSER: 2 glass dispensers in this package for diverse drinks needs at one time without extra purchase, and each one is 10.7” H, 6.8” W and 4.2” W of the opening, 1 gallon of the capacity. The fancy containers to hold with fruit punch, pink champagne punch, mint/cucumber/lime punch and other regular punch, also perfect for sangria, lemonade, iced tea, infused water, juice and homemade alcoholic beverages. PREMIUM MATERIAL: Made of high-quality food-grade glass, much sturdier, more durable and stable than acrylic and plastic ones, thick glass is not as easy to crack and deformed as plastic. It’s good to put ice cubes in to make iced drinks, but won't freeze and burst the bottle. Crystal clear glass looks beautiful with nice and colorful beverage inside and makes it more attractive at your party. 18/8 STAINLESS STEEL SPIGOT: Our spigot is made of superior 18/8 stainless steel, no coating, no painting, no peeling. Rust-proof and corrosion-proof for long-term use. Smooth switch turning is easy to use. Compared with some metal-like plastic spigots with coating outside that tend to crack and chipped off, ours is healthier and stronger. (Easy assembly only needs to follow the instructions and make every step securely installed.) HANGING CHALKBOARD: Contained in the package are two hanging wooden chalkboards for naming your homemade drinks especially when you have special recipes. Unlike ordinary stickers on the dispenser which are always flaked off, hanging board can be removed off when washing and texted with different names for different beverages. Also, the wooden chalkboards look more vintage with the embossed crafts on the dispenser body making it more stylish and chic. MULTIPLE USES IN MANY OCCASIONS: Big capacity and convenient use of it are not just great to hold daily simple drinks for everyday drinking, but also the best container for diverse parties like birthday party, bridal shower, gender reveal party, get-together, wedding, pink champagne party, Christmas and thanksgiving party. Also be used outdoors or carried like yard buffet, BBQ, picnic and RV-travel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81AZyM8-mUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NETANY","source_asin":"B0B3M6QBVG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-608847","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3M6QBVG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3M6QBVG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":608848,"name":"Mr. Christmas Maestro Mouse Presents The Lights and Sounds of Christmas Interactive Musical Light Show Ornament","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91HbmVCmYRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Let our Mr. Christmas Animated Maestro Mouse Presents Lights and Sounds charm your friends and family with a delightful display of music and light this holiday season. Perched upon his music stand, Maestro Mouse is designed to rest on your Christmas tree so all who pass by can ask him to play their favorite song. Just make your request from 24 holiday classics by saying, \"Hello Mr. Christmas,\" and he will play to your heart's content. For a dazzling light show, plug your lights into the control box, and he will synchronize the twinkling of the tree to your musical request. You can even ask him to turn the tree's lights on or off with a simple phrase. The perfect entertainer, Maestro Mouse will never tire of playing those festive tunes, and your family will enjoy his performances all season long.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91HbmVCmYRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mr. Christmas","source_asin":"B00ASA1QMS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-608848","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ASA1QMS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ASA1QMS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
