window.products.push({"id":608908,"name":"LOUISE STURHLING Stainless Steel Natural Ceramic Coated 5.8Qt Air Fryer XL Oven Cooker. BPA-FREE, PTFE & PFOA-FREE, Lead & Cadmium Free, 8-in-1 Pre-Pr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-tvjaRyhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SMART & HEALTHY WAY TO COOK WITH LESS OIL: Bake, Grill, or Fry foods the HEALTHY with up to 90% less oil than traditional deep frying using super-hot Cyclonic Air in a large Multi-purpose Ceramic Coated Basket that is designed for Maximum Air flow giving you crispier and delicious cooking each time. Ceramic coat is extremely DURABLE & CLEANS with EASE! WILL NOT PEEL under high temperature Or SCRATCH easily! Basket is removeable and Dishwasher safe. CHILD-SAFETY ENABLED & DESIGNED WITH SAFE MATERIEAL: Designed in Sunny California with Safety in mind. Machine has Child-Safety auto shut-off device built-in the door that turns off the machine when the door is open. Door Must be Closed FIRMLY to disengage auto shut-off Child-Safety Switch. Furthermore, our proprietary Ceramic Coating material is Ultra-pure and BPA-Free & Teflon-FREE Enjoy the peace of mind knowing that you are cooking with Natural Ceramic Coated BASKET. LARGE, SLEEK, & ENERGY-EFFICIENT DESIGNED: Sleek & sturdy design of highly polished stainless steel will enhance the look of any kitchen. Vented Circular Basket Design allow free flow of hot cyclonic Air from powerful fan allows for efficient air circulation for fast crispier cooking to feed 3 - 5 people. Large 5.8qt basket can fit up to 5-pound chicken ADVANCED PRE-PROGRAMMED SETTINGS: Features 8-in-1 Pre-programmed One-touch Settings and a programmable cooking timer of up to 30 minutes and a temperature control system with a range of 175⁰F – 400⁰F. With just a one-touch selection, one can select and cook 8 different meals or be creative and use the adjustable temperature and timer to create any oven or fryer-inspired meal you can imagine. UL, Intertek & ETL CERTIFIED: High power 1700W with Enhanced Turbo Air flow. Certified by UL, ETL & Intertek. 30-day Returns and 12-Month Warranty. Plus, our Latest Edition Cookbook","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-tvjaRyhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LOUISE STURHLING","source_asin":"B0962SH5ZC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-608908","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0962SH5ZC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0962SH5ZC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
