window.products.push({"id":608977,"name":"PouchWorth 50 pcs 16 oz Matte Black Foil Stand Up Zipper Pouch Coffee Bags with Valve","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51g-LbdmhbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"50 pcs 16 Once Matte Black Aluminum Foil Coffee Bags Stand Up Coffee Pouches with One Way Degassing Valve Coffee Bags with Valve 16 oz50 COUNT COFFE BAGS: 50 pieces of High Barrier Foil Stand up Zipper Pouch Coffee Bags With Valve 16 oz. The coffee bag vent is designed to keep your coffee as fresh and delicious as possible. It also can be used to store some food, such as candy or cookies but perfect fit for roast ground coffee and coffee beans whole beans.HOLD 16 oz GROUND COFFEE BAG WITH VALVE: Black coffee bag with valve 12oz are popularly used as coffee bean packaging. Black coffee bags with valve also have foil inside, perfect coffee in a bag as whole bean coffee bag or roast ground coffee bags.ONE-WAY DEGASSING VALVE: These coffee pouches are equipped with a one-way degassing valve. Coffee bags with a valve provides an ingenious way of keeping your coffee beans in good shape so that each cup you make tastes as fresh as ever.RELIABLE ZIPPER SEAL: The top of these coffee pouches can be securely shut by pressing together the two interlocking plastic strips which come together to form a tight grip seal. Coffee stand up pouch seal can be reclosed after opening to preserve the freshness of the coffee products inside.SECURE HEAT SEAL: For maximized product security, heat-seal the bags with an impulse heat sealer. Once sealed, the coffee pouch bags will be airtight and tamper-proof. This coffee bag with valve will allow the gases inside to escape and the heat seal will ensure no outside gases can enter into the bag.SPECIFICATIONMaterial: PET/VMPET/PE 110 + Matte OilThickness: 4 mil (110um)Width: 190mm (7 1/2inch)Length: 292mm (11 1/2inch)Gusset: 102mm (4inch)Zipper: YesTear Notch: YesValve: Yes (5 Hole)Side Seal: 9.5mmRound Corner: YesHang Hole: NoColor: Matte BlackBarrier Level: GreatRe-closable ZipperTear Notch","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51g-LbdmhbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PouchWorth","source_asin":"B09B2HZHRN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-608977","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B2HZHRN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B2HZHRN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
